{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2022-01-05 16:15:00', 'title': 'ILLUMINA ENTERS CO-DEVELOPMENT PARTNERSHIP WITH SOMALOGIC', 'text': "SAN DIEGO, JAN. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ILLUMINA, INC. (NASDAQ: ILMN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE CO-DEVELOPMENT AGREEMENT WITH SOMALOGIC TO BRING THE SOMASCAN® PROTEOMICS ASSAY ONTO ILLUMINA'S CURRENT AND FUTURE HIGH THROUGHPUT NEXT-GENERATION SEQUENCING (NGS) PLATFORMS. THIS PARTNERSHIP ACCELERATES THE RAPIDLY GROWING HIGH THROUGHPUT SECTOR OF THE PROTEOMICS MARKET."}